{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u5206\u52723.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/about2.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Zombie Epoch: Deck Apocalypse</i></strong> is a post-apocalyptic survival game that blends dungeon exploration with card-based strategy. As a survivor, you must venture into perilous ruins, scavenge scarce resources, build a powerful deck, and enhance your abilities to withstand relentless zombie hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every expedition is a battle for survival\u2014you must carefully choose your path, manage resources wisely, and craft your own playstyle from randomly obtained items and cards while facing increasingly formidable enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you grow stronger, you'll unlock more challenging areas, rare items, and powerful cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ultimate goal is not just survival, but the restoration of humanity\u2014rekindling the flames of civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u6536\u96c6\u7269\u8d44.gif?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map is randomly generated, with different items, cards, and zombies appearing in every run. You'll need to plan your movement carefully, explore dungeons, and collect vital supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u5206\u52723.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/gameff.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u9009\u53d6\u6218\u5229\u54c12.gif?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of rewards and build a unique playstyle to counter the ever-growing zombie threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u6218\u5229\u54c1\u8bf4\u660e.gif?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot is divided into <strong>cards</strong> and <strong>items</strong>\u2014cards can be played directly in battle, while items provide passive effects. Most cards and items can stack, creating powerful synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u5bb6\u56edgif.gif?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each dungeon run, you can unlock or upgrade buildings at your camp, permanently enhancing your character\u2019s abilities and preparing for greater challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/cards.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a variety of characters, each with unique traits. As you progress, you'll unlock new characters, each offering a distinct gameplay experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u5206\u52723.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Strategic Cardplay</strong><br>Construct your own deck and item combinations to adapt to different combat scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike Dungeon Exploration</strong><br>Designed for high replayability\u2014each run is a fresh experience, full of surprises and tough choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rebuild Humanity</strong><br>Gather resources, rebuild your base, and unlock new technologies to reclaim the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m an indie game developer, and this game is entirely created by me. If you like it, follow me and join my Discord! </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579890?t=1744450694","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/4d620a5e9c92876c560b71f7cdc1b72019ec8609/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744450694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/726eb1fb37c744469ace18a79b48b430da16db7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744450694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/726eb1fb37c744469ace18a79b48b430da16db7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744450694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3630500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u5206\u52723.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/about2.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Zombie Epoch: Deck Apocalypse</i></strong> is a post-apocalyptic survival game that blends dungeon exploration with card-based strategy. As a survivor, you must venture into perilous ruins, scavenge scarce resources, build a powerful deck, and enhance your abilities to withstand relentless zombie hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every expedition is a battle for survival\u2014you must carefully choose your path, manage resources wisely, and craft your own playstyle from randomly obtained items and cards while facing increasingly formidable enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you grow stronger, you'll unlock more challenging areas, rare items, and powerful cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ultimate goal is not just survival, but the restoration of humanity\u2014rekindling the flames of civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u6536\u96c6\u7269\u8d44.gif?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map is randomly generated, with different items, cards, and zombies appearing in every run. You'll need to plan your movement carefully, explore dungeons, and collect vital supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u5206\u52723.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/gameff.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u9009\u53d6\u6218\u5229\u54c12.gif?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of rewards and build a unique playstyle to counter the ever-growing zombie threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u6218\u5229\u54c1\u8bf4\u660e.gif?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot is divided into <strong>cards</strong> and <strong>items</strong>\u2014cards can be played directly in battle, while items provide passive effects. Most cards and items can stack, creating powerful synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u5bb6\u56edgif.gif?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each dungeon run, you can unlock or upgrade buildings at your camp, permanently enhancing your character\u2019s abilities and preparing for greater challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/cards.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a variety of characters, each with unique traits. As you progress, you'll unlock new characters, each offering a distinct gameplay experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/extras/\u5206\u52723.png?t=1744450694\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Strategic Cardplay</strong><br>Construct your own deck and item combinations to adapt to different combat scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike Dungeon Exploration</strong><br>Designed for high replayability\u2014each run is a fresh experience, full of surprises and tough choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rebuild Humanity</strong><br>Gather resources, rebuild your base, and unlock new technologies to reclaim the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019m an indie game developer, and this game is entirely created by me. If you like it, follow me and join my Discord! </p></li></ul>","developers":["HY Indie Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579890/661cdc331d33986f1912225eb